or 30 bucks the pass  will include special color variants on  the game's launch day two packs  including new heroes quests and  challenges and a story expansion set to  be released by the end of 2023 amiibo  support was also confirmed for xc3  allowing players to scan every amiibo  for extra items hit the comments and let  me know your hype levels for xenoblade 3  while i tell you all about how i'm  excited for the new stuff coming to  forza horizon 5. the game's latest  update adds story mode co-op a new event  and new hot wheels cars and cosmetics  ahead of the july expansion release the  patch also fixes a number of  high-profile bugs adds convertible  functionality to some of the cars plus  add support for a handful of new  languages in both subtitles and  voiceovers with the amount of content  that's being added and tweaked users  have reported that the patch is a hefty  one with a file size of around 16 gigs  on xbox series x and 12 gigs on the xbox  one for the full list of patch notes  i'll have a link in the description and  if you made it this far into the video  go ahead and hit the comment section and  let me know what you preferred growing  up or what you prefer now matchbox or  hot wheels i recently found out that  they're both made by mattel so like  they're almost the same thing why why  did i hate matchbox growing up  you
 

